    },
    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct bad\">-22%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Abaixo da média. Mande para a Oferenda ou o NPC.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">ATK do seu contra um Naclstack médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>-24%</b></div><div><small>ATK do máximo possível</small><b>39%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>2.676</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,88.9 197.7,112.5 201.7,169.8 150.0,190.3 101.7,167.9 109.6,116.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,102.3 187.0,118.6 190.1,163.1 150.0,178.9 112.6,161.6 120.1,122.7\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 223, médio 302, máximo 650\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:28.335451080050827%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:38.37357052096569%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(82.59212198221093% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">223</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 231, médio 298, máximo 595\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:29.35196950444727%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:37.865311308767474%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(75.60355781448538% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">231</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 331, médio 427, máximo 787\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:42.058449809402795%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:54.2566709021601%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">331</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 168, médio 217, máximo 475\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:21.346886912325285%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:27.573062261753496%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(60.35578144853876% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">168</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 243, médio 314, máximo 619\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:30.876747141041932%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:39.898348157560356%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(78.65311308767471% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">243</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 163, médio 220, máximo 519\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:20.71156289707751%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:27.95425667090216%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(65.94663278271919% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">163</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
    },
    "imp": {
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0\">Os golpes de dano dele são físicos: o <b>ATK</b> (base 60) decide o dano. SpATK não ajuda em nada.</p>\n   <div class=\"mins\">\n    <div><small>Qualidade mínima</small><b>1,3</b><span>sai em ~26% das capturas, cerca de 4</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de ATK</small><b>20+</b><span>a média é 16,5</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de HP e DEF</small><b>16+</b><span>define quanto aguenta antes da poção</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SPD</small><b>livre</b><span>só encurta a recarga</span></div>\n   </div>\n   <div><b>Para comparar dois Naclstack</b><ol class=\"prio\"><li>Maior qualidade.</li><li>Empate de qualidade (até 0,05): maior IV de ATK.</li><li>Depois IV de HP e DEF.</li><li>P2 e P3 desempatam. P4, P5 ou shiny passam na frente de tudo.</li></ol></div>\n   <div class=\"mult\">\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Bate forte</b><small>esses tipos apanham ×2+ dos golpes dele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d9774a\"><i></i>Fogo<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#7fc2c2\"><i></i>Gelo<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a8fd6\"><i></i>Voador<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#98a83a\"><i></i>Inseto<em>×2</em></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Sofre de</b><small>esses tipos batem ×2,5+ nele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#5d84cf\"><i></i>Água<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#b0483f\"><i></i>Lutador<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9ea3b3\"><i></i>Metálico<em>×2,5</em></span></div>\n   </div>"
    },
    "escada": {
      "html": "<p class=\"note\">Naclstack não está no guia de evoluções da comunidade (só Kanto e algumas cadeias). Pelo estágio (meio, ou 1º de cadeia de dois), a regra geral fora de Kanto é: forma do meio no Nv 40, última forma no Nv 100.</p>"
    },
    "hunt-lede": {
      "text": "35 hunts entre o Nv 180 e o Nv 310 simuladas com o seu exemplar. 8 são seguras (no pior intervalo de 5 s ele leva menos de 50% do HP). No topo ficam as que somam mais abates por hora em hunts de nível mais alto, que pagam mais."
    },
